===Etymology===
{{etyl|de}} {{term|Marzipan|lang=de}}, earlier {{term|marcipan|lang=de}}, a misinterpretation of {{etyl|it}} {{term|marzapane|lang=it}} (as if from Latin {{term|Marci|lang=la}} {{term|panis|lang=la}} ‘Mark's bread’), now thought originally to come from [[w:Martaban|Martaban]], a Burmese port known for its spice exports.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# a [[confection]] of [[almond]] [[paste]], [[sugar]] and [[egg white]]

